{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T22:46:33+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "UNO", "steam_appid": 470220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4631620, 4502610, 4093730, 3976180, 2997210, 1903460, 1755710, 1557490, 1599770, 1246520, 560940, 560941, 571810, 5217890], "detailed_description": "<h1>Comparison Grid</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras/f6bf9e5f19af21d8ac40cbde2cd3dd35.avif?t=1791965305\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras_big/f6bf9e5f19af21d8ac40cbde2cd3dd35.avif?t=1791965305 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>UNO™ Ultimate Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNO™ Ultimate Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNO™, the iconic card game you love, now with new ways to play and connect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNO™ Flip!, which elevates your UNO™ matches with a double-sided deck and new action cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNO™ 50th Anniversary and its gorgeous velvety cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNO™ Party! Mania™, which introduces 3 new action cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNO™ Show ‘Em No Mercy™ turns up the heat with the most unforgiving version yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNO FLEX!™ with its action cards and high-impact power mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play like a Viking in UNO™ Valhalla, where the board is part of the gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• In UNO™ The Call of Yara, the DLC brings resource management into the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Play an action-packed game mode featuring characters from Immortals Fenyx Rising in UNO™ Fenyx's Quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Get ready to move with the UNO™ Just Dance theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNO™ Rayman adds a playful twist with lush visuals and four unique Theme Cards.</p></p><br><h1>UNO™ Legacy Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNO™ Legacy Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNO™, the iconic card game you love, now with new ways to play and connect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNO™ Flip!, which elevates your UNO™ matches with a double-sided deck and new action cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNO™ 50th Anniversary and its gorgeous velvety cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNO™ Party! Mania™, which introduces 3 new action cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNO™ Show ‘Em No Mercy™ turns up the heat with the most unforgiving version yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• UNO FLEX!™ with its action cards and high-impact power mechanics.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNO™ turns the iconic card game into a vibrant, customizable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match cards by color, number, or symbol, play action cards to spice things up, and race against others to empty your hand first. Don’t forget to shout “UNO!” when you’re down to your last card!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s the UNO you love, now with new ways to play and connect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY IT YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras/32d72801f52788bff836b07d4dcb3cf0.poster.avif?t=1791965305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras/32d72801f52788bff836b07d4dcb3cf0.webm?t=1791965305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras/32d72801f52788bff836b07d4dcb3cf0.mp4?t=1791965305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in 2v2, or battle it out in free-for-all matches, either online or on the couch. Combine House Rules like Jump-In and Stacking or 7-0 swaps to create your perfect kind of chaos. For even more variety, expand your game with exciting DLCs, each bringing fresh mechanics and a unique twist to the card game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLECT, CUSTOMIZE, AND SHOW OFF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras/dd307cc7572a16cae1d3f184dba19b6d.poster.avif?t=1791965305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras/dd307cc7572a16cae1d3f184dba19b6d.webm?t=1791965305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras/dd307cc7572a16cae1d3f184dba19b6d.mp4?t=1791965305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With MyDesign, you can personalize every part of your UNO experience. Unlock colorful boards, card decks, music, avatars, and more with your coins, and start creating your own game space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JUMP INTO THE ONLINE FUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras/332ed1b75e0a3ec8856ca3c605580dcf.poster.avif?t=1791965305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras/332ed1b75e0a3ec8856ca3c605580dcf.webm?t=1791965305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras/332ed1b75e0a3ec8856ca3c605580dcf.mp4?t=1791965305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every week during Happy Hour, a different DLC is free to try. Explore fresh gameplay, wild rules, and themed decks available for a limited time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to join the UNO community on Twitch! Streamers can turn on Chat Chaos mode, letting viewers vote and influence the match in real time. A Twitch extension is also available for even more ways to interact!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UNO™ turns the iconic card game into a vibrant, customizable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match cards by color, number, or symbol, play action cards to spice things up, and race against others to empty your hand first. Don’t forget to shout “UNO!” when you’re down to your last card!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s the UNO you love, now with new ways to play and connect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY IT YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras/32d72801f52788bff836b07d4dcb3cf0.poster.avif?t=1791965305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras/32d72801f52788bff836b07d4dcb3cf0.webm?t=1791965305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/470220/extras/32d72801f52788bff836b07d4dcb3cf0.mp4?t=1791965305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in 2v2, or battle it out in free-for-all matches, either online or on the couch. Combine House Rules like Jump-In and Stacking or 7-0 swaps to create your perfect kind of chaos. For even more variety, expand your game with exciting DLCs, each bringing fresh mechanics and a unique twist to the card game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><